# Shopping App Rules

- Three services must remain: `shopping-client` (React + Redux Toolkit), `server-net` (.NET 10 + SQL Server + EF), `server-node` (Express + MongoDB).
- Do not reintroduce mock/fallback successful orders when APIs fail.
- Keep order create response as `{ id, status }`.
- Prefer RTK Query for HTTP and typed Redux hooks in the client.
- Validate orders on the server (Zod) in addition to client checks.
- Keep Hebrew RTL user-facing copy unless asked otherwise.
- Documentation for AI tools and file guides stays in English.
- Read `AGENTS.md`, `PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md`, and the relevant `FILE_GUIDE.md` before large changes.
